[{"id":"hs-order-phases","itemId":"handshake","role":"core","promptHtml":"<code class=\"nobreak\">hs_cross</code> carries an 8-bit value from <code class=\"nobreak\">clk_a</code>'s side to <code class=\"nobreak\">clk_b</code>'s with a handshake: <code class=\"nobreak\">req</code> crosses one way and <code class=\"nobreak\">ack</code> the other, each through a synchroniser. Put in order one value's round trip.","explanationHtml":"<p>Each step waits to see the one before it, through a synchroniser. The value is held from the edge at which <code class=\"nobreak\">req</code> rises until <code class=\"nobreak\">ack</code> comes back, so <code class=\"nobreak\">clk_b</code>'s side can take all eight bits at once. The tempting slip is to send the next value as soon as <code class=\"nobreak\">ack</code> rises: the round trip ends only when both <code class=\"nobreak\">req</code> and <code class=\"nobreak\">ack</code> are down again.</p>","type":"order","steps":["clk_a's side holds the value still and raises req.","clk_b's side sees req, takes the value and raises ack.","clk_a's side sees ack and lowers req.","clk_b's side sees req fall and lowers ack.","clk_a's side sees ack fall, and may send the next value."],"shuffled":[4,2,1,3,0]},{"id":"hs-predict-ack","itemId":"handshake","role":"core","promptHtml":"This is <code class=\"nobreak\">hs_cross</code>, with <code class=\"nobreak\">clk_b</code> drawn as the cycles. <code class=\"nobreak\">req</code>, from <code class=\"nobreak\">clk_a</code>'s side, rises in cycle 0 and falls in cycle 3. <code class=\"nobreak\">ack</code> is a register on <code class=\"nobreak\">clk_b</code> that takes <code class=\"nobreak\">req_b</code>, which is <code class=\"nobreak\">req</code> after a <code class=\"nobreak\">sync2</code>. Set <code class=\"nobreak\">ack</code> for every cycle.","explanationHtml":"<p>The synchroniser takes the rise of <code class=\"nobreak\">req</code> at the edges of cycles 1 and 2, so <code class=\"nobreak\">req_b</code> is 1 from cycle 2, and <code class=\"nobreak\">ack</code> takes it at cycle 3's edge. The fall goes the same way: <code class=\"nobreak\">req_b</code> at cycle 5, <code class=\"nobreak\">ack</code> at cycle 6. Each crossing costs three edges of <code class=\"nobreak\">clk_b</code> here, and the round trip two crossings each way.</p>","type":"waveform","wave":{"id":"hs-ack","source":"hdl/level-09/hs_cross/hs_cross_tb.sv","timescale":"1ps","period":33376,"periodText":"33.376 ns","unit":"cycle","cycles":8,"signals":[{"label":"clk_b","path":"hs_cross_tb.clk_b","width":1,"role":"clock","changes":[[0,"1"],[0.5,"0"],[1,"1"],[1.5,"0"],[2,"1"],[2.5,"0"],[3,"1"],[3.5,"0"],[4,"1"],[4.5,"0"],[5,"1"],[5.5,"0"],[6,"1"],[6.5,"0"],[7,"1"],[7.5,"0"]]},{"label":"req","path":"hs_cross_tb.dut.req","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"0"],[0.5448,"1"],[3.8406,"0"],[6.8368,"1"]]},{"label":"ack","path":"hs_cross_tb.dut.ack","width":1,"role":"signal","changes":[[0,"0"],[3,"1"],[6,"0"]],"samples":["0","0","0","1","1","1","0","0"]}]},"answer":"ack"},{"id":"hs-fill-ready","itemId":"handshake","role":"core","promptHtml":"In <code class=\"nobreak\">hs_cross</code>, <code class=\"nobreak\">clk_a</code>'s side may send a new value only when the round trip of the last one is over. <code class=\"nobreak\">ack_a</code> is <code class=\"nobreak\">ack</code> after a synchroniser on <code class=\"nobreak\">clk_a</code>. Fill in <code class=\"nobreak\">ready</code>.","explanationHtml":"<p><code class=\"nobreak\">ready</code> is <code>~req &amp; ~ack_a</code>: <code class=\"nobreak\">req</code> is down, and <code class=\"nobreak\">ack</code>, as <code class=\"nobreak\">clk_a</code>'s side sees it, is down too. With <code class=\"nobreak\">~req</code> alone, <code class=\"nobreak\">req</code> could fall and rise again before <code class=\"nobreak\">clk_b</code>'s side, through its synchroniser, had seen it fall: to <code class=\"nobreak\">clk_b</code>'s side, <code class=\"nobreak\">req</code> would never have moved, and the new value would never be taken.</p>","type":"fill","file":"hdl/level-09/hs_cross/hs_cross.sv","firstLine":29,"totalLines":53,"before":["  always_ff @(posedge clk_a)","    if (rst_a) begin","      req <= 1'b0;","    end else if (ready & send) begin","      req  <= 1'b1;","      held <= data_a;","    end else if (ack_a) begin","      req  <= 1'b0;","    end",""],"blankLine":{"left":"  assign ready = ","right":";"},"after":[],"highlighted":{"before":[[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"always_ff","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"@","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":"(","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"posedge","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" clk_a)","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"    ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"if","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" (rst_a) ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"begin","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true}],[{"text":"      req ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"<=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"1'b0","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":";","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"    ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"end","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"else","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"if","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" (ready ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"&","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" send) ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"begin","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true}],[{"text":"      req  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"<=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"1'b1","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":";","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"      held ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"<=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" data_a;","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"    ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"end","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"else","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"if","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" (ack_a) ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"begin","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true}],[{"text":"      req  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"<=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"1'b0","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":";","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"    ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"end","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true}],[]],"blankLine":{"left":[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"assign","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ready ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],"right":[{"text":";","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}]},"after":[]},"accept":["~req & ~ack_a","~ack_a & ~req"],"caseSensitive":true,"blankLabel":"When ready is 1"}]